            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Batyo baamatarisi baatwara ebaruha ezirikuruga aha mugabe n'abanyiginya be, baazibuzya Israeli na Yuda yoona, ezirikugamba ekiragiro ky'omugabe naagira ati: Imwe Baisraeli 'mwe, mugarukire MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Abrahamu, owa Isaaka kandi owa Israeli, nawe abone kubagarukira, imwe abatsigaireho, abaahonokire omu mikono y'omugabe wa Asiria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.29.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 29:8",
