        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima abantu baingi baateeranira Yerusaalemu kwijuka obugyenyi bw'emigaati etatumbisiibwe omu kwezi kwa kabiri, bari omutwe muhango munonga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.13",
