            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Baimuka, baiha Yerusaalemu amatambiro agaabaire gariyo, n'ebyoterero by'okwotereraho obubaane byona baabitwara, baabinaga omu kagyera Kidirooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.14",
