            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.35.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "35:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZR.6.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezr 6:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Batyo baita omwana gw'entaama gw'Okuhingurwaho aha kiro kya ikumi na bina omu kwezi kwa kabiri. Abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi baakwatwa enshoni, baayeyeza, baareeta ebitambo by'okwotsya omu nju ya MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.35.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 35:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Baayemerera omu myanya yaabo nk'emigyenzo yaabo oku yaabaire eri, nibakuratira ekiragiro kya Musa omushaija wa Ruhanga; abanyamurwa baamiisha eshagama ei baahairwe Abaleevi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahabw'okuba hakaba hariho baingi omu mutwe ogwo abaabaire bateeyerize; nikyo kyareeteire Abaleevi kwita omwana gw'entaama gw'Okuhingurwaho ahabwa buri muntu weena owaabaire atashemeire, okubeereza MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahakuba abantu bainti munonga omu Baefuraimu, Abamanaase, Abaisakaari n'Abazebuluuni bakaba bateeyerize, baafa okurya omwana gw'entaama gw'Okuhingurwaho omu muringo ogutarikwikirizibwa biragiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.19.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 19:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ahabw'okuba Hezekia akaba abashabiire naagira ati: MUKAMA omurungi asaasire buri muntu, omaririire kusherura Ruhanga, MUKAMA Ruhanga wa baishenkuru, n'obu araabe ateeziibwe nk'emigyenzo y'Omwanya ogurikwera oku eri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yaahurira Hezekia, yaakiza abantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kur 12:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.13.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "13:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZR.6.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezr 6:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima Abaisraeli abo abaabaire bari Yerusaalemu baamara ebiro mushanju nibaijuka obugyenyi bw'emigaati etatumbisiibwe n'okushemererwa kwingi munonga; kandi Abaleevi n'abanyamurwa baaguma nibahimbisa MUKAMA buri izooba, nibamweshongorera n'amaani gaabo goona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.5.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lev 5:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi Hezekia yaagamba ebigambo by'okwezirikisa Abaleevi boona abayorekire obwengye omu murimo gw'okuheereza MUKAMA. Batyo abantu baarya eby'okurya by'obugyenyi okumara ebiro mushanju, nibahonga empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye, nibasiima MUKAMA Ruhanga wa baishenkurubo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
