          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima omutwe gwona gwasiima kweyongyera ebindi biro mushanju omu bugyenyi; batyo baamara ebyo biro nibashemererwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.29.34"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 29:34",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ahabw'okuba Hezekia omugabe wa Yuda akaha omutwe gw'abantu enimi rukumi n'entaama enkumi mushanju kuba ebitambo; abanyiginya nabo baaha ogwo mutwe enimi rukumi n'entaama kakumi; n'abanyamurwa baingi baayeyeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omutwe gwona ogw'Abayuda n'abanyamurwa n'Abaleevi, n'omutwe gwona ogwarugire omuri Israeli n'abashuhuuki abaarugire omu nsi ya Israeli n'abashuhuuki abaabaire batwire omuri Yuda, baashemererwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.7.8+2CH.7.9+2CH.7.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 7:8-10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " N'ahabw'ekyo haabaho okushemererwa kwingi munonga omuri Yerusaalemu, ahabw'okuba okwiha obu obusingye bwa Sulemaani mwene Daudi omugabe wa Israeli bwarugaho hakaba hatakabahoga bugyenyi nk'obwo omuri Yerusaalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:27"
